.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-capture-list 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-capture\-list \- List this repository\*(Aqs captures as handles, in a fixed order
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten capture list\fR [\fB\-\-stream\fR] [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List this repository\*(Aqs captures as handles, in a fixed order
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stream\fR
Only captures of this stream
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
